	c8 c~ c2 c4 | g8 g4. g4 g8 c,~ | c8 c~ c2 b'8 bes~ | bes1 |

	% part "A"
	aes2 bes8 aes bes aes~ | aes2 bes8 aes bes aes | b8 bes4 bes8~ bes4 b8 bes~ | bes2. aes4 |
	b8 bes4 b8~ b4. bes8~ | bes4. b8~ b4. bes8~ | bes4 aes~ aes4. f8~ | f4. aes8~ aes2~ | aes1 |
